Chapter: SceneProbe
  cites Diag chapter DiagScene
  cites Works chapter GopDraw
  cites Kernel chapter BitmapFont
  cites Engine chapter Renderer3D
  cites Works chapter GopHandoff

 The scene and its camera live in Diag chapter DiagScene since 2026-08-18,
 where the diagnostic ladder's scene stage renders them into its row; this
 chapter is the one-question image that renders them full-panel.

 We say:

Section: Panel
  sidebar : Integer = 160
  taskbar : Integer = 24

Section: Entry

  spin : Integer -> Integer
  spin (i) = if i >= 2000000000 then 0 else spin (i + 1)

  opening : Integer
  opening =
    let base = boot-fb-base 0
    in let w = boot-fb-w 0
    in let h = boot-fb-h 0
    in let stride = boot-fb-stride 0
    in let font = cbf-init
    in let wash = gop-fill-rect base stride 0 0 w h dsc-band
    in let cw = w - sidebar
    in let ch = h - taskbar
    in let tgt = r3d-target-at (base + sidebar * 4) stride cw ch dsc-sky
    in let scene = dsc-scene 0
    in let d = r3d-render-into tgt scene
    in let l1 = gop-draw-text base stride font 8 8 "SCENE" 65535 1 0
    in let l2 = gop-draw-text base stride font 8 24 (show w & "x" & show h) 65535 1 0
    in let l3 = gop-draw-text base stride font 8 40 ("stride " & show stride) 65535 1 0
    in let l4 = gop-draw-text base stride font (sidebar + 8) (ch + 4) "software 3D, no GPU" 65280 1 0
    in spin 0

